{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "exchange_purchase.schema.json",
  "title": "Exchange purchase by an open-access consumer",
  "description": "Whether, and on what conditions, a consumer may buy power on the exchange (IEX) through open access in a state. Every field is either stated (cited in field_refs under its JSON pointer, e.g. /schedule) or not_stated with the regulation to obtain. engine.exchange turns a row into a verdict: feasible, feasible with conditions, not practical, or not yet sourced.",
